{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB 娛樂訪談節目《一周星星》，今晚（22 日）最新一集請來熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》四位女主角楊茜堯、林夏薇、姚子羚與傅嘉莉擔任嘉賓，接受主持許文軒訪問。</p><p>節目中四人輪流大爆片場秘聞，楊茜堯重溫入行片段時一度感觸爆喊，話題十足！</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:23:47.210763+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:02:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:12.134434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:12.134434+00:00","content_hash":"7a753f787de48470beef585fa4bb196af03814b1b16afce6506aa6782e5469a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}